Wintun (Layer 3 TUN driver for Windows)
----------------------------------------

Shipped with the Windows build only, as `wintun.dll` in the `openconnect\`
directory beside openconnect.exe (openconnect loads it from its own directory to
create the virtual VPN network adapter).

  Component : Wintun
  Version   : 0.14.1
  Source    : Preferably the MSYS2 `mingw-w64-x86_64-wintun` package; otherwise
              the official signed build https://www.wintun.net/builds/wintun-0.14.1.zip
              (amd64 wintun.dll), pinned and sha256-verified in CI
              (sha256 07c256185d6ee3652e09fa55c0b673e2624b565e02c4b9091c79ca7d2f24ef51).

Wintun's source code is licensed GPL-2.0; the precompiled, Microsoft-signed DLLs
distributed in the official ZIP are released by WireGuard LLC under a more
permissive "Prebuilt Binaries License" (redistribution of the unmodified signed
binary is permitted), the text of which is included in that ZIP. Upstream:
https://www.wintun.net/ and https://git.zx2c4.com/wintun/ .
